---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="SMS & Email Consent (A2P 10DLC) | Mailbox Plus"
  description="The express written consent terms for receiving email and SMS text message communications from Mailbox Plus of Ohio, LLC — service notifications, package arrival alerts, billing reminders, and account updates."
  canonical="/sms-consent"
>
  <section class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 py-16">
    <h1 class="text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold text-[var(--color-text-primary)] mb-4">SMS &amp; Email Consent (A2P 10DLC)</h1>
    <p class="text-[var(--color-text-secondary)] mb-8"><strong>Last updated:</strong> August 2026</p>

    <div class="prose prose-lg max-w-none text-[var(--color-text-primary)] space-y-6">
      <p>This page states the express written consent terms (the "Consent") for receiving email and SMS text message communications from <strong>Mailbox Plus of Ohio, LLC</strong>. This Consent is Clause 13 of the <a href="/terms/">Mailbox Service Agreement</a> and is reproduced here in full.</p>

      <h2>What you may consent to</h2>
      <p>By providing your email address and/or mobile phone number and affirmatively consenting, you give Mailbox Plus permission to contact you by email and/or SMS text message for:</p>
      <ul>
        <li>Service notifications</li>
        <li>Package arrival alerts</li>
        <li>Billing reminders</li>
        <li>Important account updates</li>
        <li>Customer service follow-ups</li>
      </ul>

      <h2>The Consent</h2>
      <p>By giving consent, you understand and agree:</p>
      <ul>
        <li>Message frequency varies based on service activity (e.g., package arrival alerts, invoices, reminders).</li>
        <li>Message and data rates may apply depending on your mobile carrier.</li>
        <li>You may opt out of SMS messages at any time by replying <strong>STOP</strong>, and may opt out of email communications by clicking the unsubscribe link or contacting Mailbox Plus directly.</li>
        <li>For help with SMS messages, reply <strong>HELP</strong>.</li>
        <li>Consent to receive email or SMS text messages is <strong>not a condition</strong> of receiving mailbox services or entering into the Mailbox Service Agreement.</li>
        <li>You affirm that the phone number and email address you provide belong to you and are accurate.</li>
      </ul>

      <h2>Where consent is recorded</h2>
      <p>When you sign up for a mailbox plan that includes text and email alerts, you are asked to affirm this Consent during checkout. Your typed confirmation, phone number, and the date and time of your acceptance are recorded on your account for compliance purposes.</p>

      <h2>Contact</h2>
      <p>Questions about this Consent or to withdraw it at any time, contact us at <a href="mailto:help@mailboxplusohio.com">help@mailboxplusohio.com</a> or call (440) 709-1946.</p>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
